"the calling task is suspended. It is possible to immediately resume the task, or escape the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"continuation in order to complete it afterwards, which will then resume the suspended task."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"resume(throwing:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is called on the continuation, this function throws that error."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must invoke the continuation’s "},{"code":"resume","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method exactly once."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Missing to invoke it (eventually) will cause the calling task to remain suspended"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indefinitely which will result in the task “hanging” as well as being leaked with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no possibility to destroy it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The checked continuation offers detection of misuse, and dropping the last reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to it, without having resumed it will trigger a warning. Resuming a continuation twice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also diagnosed and will cause a crash."}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"See Also","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"withCheckedContinuation(function:_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"See Also","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"withUnsafeContinuation(function:_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"See Also","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"withUnsafeThrowingContinuation(function:_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections"